<h3>Introduction</h3>

<p>Note, the Local Tab Group is an alias to the AUI Tab Group macro provided
for backwards compatibility</p>

<p>AUI Tab Group defines a container for AUI Tab macros.  The container
can hold unlimited AUI Tab macros.</p>

<h3>Parameters</h3>

<p><strong>Vertical Orientation</strong>: If checked, tabs will be positioned vertically rather than horizontally.</p>

